  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197902",
      "title": "Continuing Work on the Expense-related Components",
      "lectureOrder": 129,
      "videoOrder": 125,
      "sourceHash": "f650727cf987e12b34197b7493f57487ed58a4c9d2bd60252ef8e70cbea26213",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 5.96,
          "en": "So now that we created the general structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.96,
          "end": 9.86,
          "en": "of our own components, it's time to add more meat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.86,
          "end": 12.683,
          "en": "to those components to make them more useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.66,
          "end": 15.67,
          "en": "Now, in ExpensesOutput.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.67,
          "end": 18.36,
          "en": "I'm getting my expenses and I expect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.36,
          "end": 20.31,
          "en": "that this is simply an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.31,
          "end": 23.33,
          "en": "of numbers or of objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.33,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "where every object represents one expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 29.35,
          "en": "and actually an expense should be an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.35,
          "end": 31.91,
          "en": "because an expense is not just a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.91,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "but also, a description and a date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 38.16,
          "en": "So I expect to get an array of objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.16,
          "end": 39.76,
          "en": "that have descriptions, dates,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.76,
          "end": 41.913,
          "en": "and numbers, and maybe an ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43,
          "end": 45.26,
          "en": "Now for the ExpensesSummary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.26,
          "end": 49.23,
          "en": "we also need a short description of the period,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.23,
          "end": 52.13,
          "en": "a short name for the period of expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.13,
          "end": 53.23,
          "en": "that we're looking at.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 56.36,
          "en": "Therefore, in ExpensesSummary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.36,
          "end": 61.36,
          "en": "I expect to get my periodName here as a prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.79,
          "end": 64.23,
          "en": "and instead of hard coding this year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "I will output periodName here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 71.86,
          "en": "Of course, for this to work in ExpensesOutput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.86,
          "end": 74.24,
          "en": "where we use the ExpensesSummary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.24,
          "end": 76.773,
          "en": "we must set this periodName prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.77,
          "end": 80.41,
          "en": "And since ExpensesOutput will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.41,
          "end": 82.553,
          "en": "in both the AllExpenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.553,
          "end": 85.59,
          "en": "and RecentExpenses screen components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.59,
          "end": 89.03999999999999,
          "en": "this also the must be a prop of ExpensesOutput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.03999999999999,
          "end": 91.78999999999999,
          "en": "Because the periodName will not be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.78999999999999,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "in this ExpensesOutput component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 96.6,
          "en": "It will be set in the two screen components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.6,
          "end": 98.913,
          "en": "that use the ExpensesOutput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 103.2,
          "en": "So besides accepting expenses as a prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.2,
          "end": 107.71000000000001,
          "en": "in ExpensesOutput, I also get my periodName here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.71000000000001,
          "end": 110.03999999999999,
          "en": "or my expensesPeriod here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.03999999999999,
          "end": 111.38,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.38,
          "end": 113.97999999999999,
          "en": "This also must be accepted as a prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.97999999999999,
          "end": 115.61,
          "en": "and then should be forwarded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.61,
          "end": 118.947,
          "en": "to the periodName prop of ExpensesSummary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.26,
          "end": 122.07,
          "en": "Now to ExpensesSummary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 126.48,
          "en": "we also should then pass our expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.48,
          "end": 128.94,
          "en": "So I will forward the expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.94,
          "end": 130.6,
          "en": "which I get as a prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.6,
          "end": 133.72,
          "en": "in ExpensesOutput to an expenses prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.72,
          "end": 135.383,
          "en": "on ExpensesSummary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.35,
          "end": 138.35,
          "en": "and this prop therefore should be accepted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.35,
          "end": 139.8,
          "en": "in ExpensesSummary.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 140.653,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.61,
          "end": 143.67000000000002,
          "en": "And we then must build the sum",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.67000000000002,
          "end": 148.05,
          "en": "of all these expenses, so of the expense amounts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.05,
          "end": 148.883,
          "en": "And for this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.883,
          "end": 152.56,
          "en": "we can calculate our expenses sum here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.56,
          "end": 154.59,
          "en": "in the ExpensesSummary component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.61,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "by taking a look at our expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 160.1,
          "en": "and as explained, this will be an array full",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.1,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "of objects. And on this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 165.123,
          "en": "we can call the built in reduced method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.1,
          "end": 168.82999999999998,
          "en": "Reduce is a standard JavaScript method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.82999999999998,
          "end": 171.78,
          "en": "that can be executed on arrays.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.78,
          "end": 175.88,
          "en": "And it allows you to combine multiple values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.88,
          "end": 178.86,
          "en": "in an array into a single value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.86,
          "end": 181.85,
          "en": "a single number, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.85,
          "end": 184.32,
          "en": "For this reduce takes a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.32,
          "end": 187.3,
          "en": "as a parameter and this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 187.3,
          "end": 190.77,
          "en": "will automatically receive the current value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.77,
          "end": 194.09,
          "en": "which will change for every function execution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 194.09,
          "end": 196.01,
          "en": "And this function will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 196.01,
          "end": 198.77,
          "en": "for every element in expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 198.77,
          "end": 200.38,
          "en": "And here that will be the sum that I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.38,
          "end": 202.05,
          "en": "to calculate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 202.05,
          "end": 203.46,
          "en": "And then the second value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.46,
          "end": 206.35,
          "en": "this inner function will receive automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.35,
          "end": 208.82999999999998,
          "en": "is the current item we're looking at.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.82999999999998,
          "end": 211.12,
          "en": "Because again, this will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.12,
          "end": 214.35,
          "en": "for every item in the expenses array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 214.35,
          "end": 216.4,
          "en": "So therefore we will get every item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 216.4,
          "end": 218.3,
          "en": "for every execution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 218.3,
          "end": 220.72,
          "en": "And we then get a total value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 220.72,
          "end": 224.16,
          "en": "which is carried over across those executions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 224.16,
          "end": 226.37,
          "en": "to build a final result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 226.37,
          "end": 228.163,
          "en": "from all these executions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.43,
          "end": 231.66,
          "en": "And here we then have to return a new value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 231.66,
          "end": 235.05,
          "en": "which will be carried over as the first argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 235.05,
          "end": 237.05,
          "en": "to the next function execution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 237.05,
          "end": 238.833,
          "en": "for the next item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 239.7,
          "end": 243.93,
          "en": "And here, I simply wanna return my sum",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 243.93,
          "end": 246.58,
          "en": "plus the expense amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 246.58,
          "end": 249.37,
          "en": "of the expense we're currently looking at.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 249.37,
          "end": 250.98,
          "en": "And for this, I simply assume",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 250.98,
          "end": 252.71,
          "en": "that expense is an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 252.71,
          "end": 255.52,
          "en": "that has an amount property and we will have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 255.52,
          "end": 257.04,
          "en": "to make sure later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 257.04,
          "end": 259.26,
          "en": "once we start creating expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 259.26,
          "end": 261.13,
          "en": "that this will be the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 261.13,
          "end": 263.853,
          "en": "that our expenses have amount properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 265.53,
          "end": 267.91,
          "en": "Now, you can also add a second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 267.91,
          "end": 271.1,
          "en": "to the reduce method after this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 271.1,
          "end": 273.36,
          "en": "which is the first argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 273.36,
          "end": 276.01,
          "en": "And this second argument is a starting value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 276.01,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "for this carryover value for the very first item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 280.95,
          "end": 282.93399999999997,
          "en": "for which this function is executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 282.93399999999997,
          "end": 284.97,
          "en": "Otherwise this would be undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 284.97,
          "end": 287.27,
          "en": "Here, I'll set a starting value of zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 287.27,
          "end": 291.09000000000003,
          "en": "So that for the first expense, sum is zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 291.09000000000003,
          "end": 293.73,
          "en": "Then the amount of that expense is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 293.73,
          "end": 296.48,
          "en": "And for the second expense, the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 296.48,
          "end": 299.4,
          "en": "of the first execution will be used as a sum",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 299.4,
          "end": 301.85,
          "en": "and the next amount is added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 301.85,
          "end": 304.23,
          "en": "and this is done for all the expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 304.23,
          "end": 306.95,
          "en": "until we have a final sum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 306.95,
          "end": 309.56,
          "en": "And that sum will then be output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 309.56,
          "end": 310.94,
          "en": "after the dollar sign,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 310.94,
          "end": 314,
          "en": "which I keep here hard coded to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 314,
          "end": 315.14300000000003,
          "en": "that total sum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 316.85,
          "end": 319.823,
          "en": "Now as a last step, I just wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 319.823,
          "end": 324.11,
          "en": "that we also call toFixed on this result here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 324.11,
          "end": 326.69,
          "en": "and pass a two toFixed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 326.69,
          "end": 328.45,
          "en": "And toFixed is a number built",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 328.45,
          "end": 330.98,
          "en": "in JavaScript method, which ensures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 330.98,
          "end": 333.42,
          "en": "that this will be output as a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 333.42,
          "end": 336.81,
          "en": "with exactly two decimal places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 336.81,
          "end": 339.22,
          "en": "If it has less than two decimal places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 339.22,
          "end": 343.3,
          "en": "it will get two decimal places, two zeros.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 343.3,
          "end": 345.76,
          "en": "If it has more than two decimal places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 345.76,
          "end": 347.7,
          "en": "those places will be cut off",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 347.7,
          "end": 349.78,
          "en": "so that we get a nice clean number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 349.78,
          "end": 352.24,
          "en": "with two decimal places being output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 352.24,
          "end": 353.39300000000003,
          "en": "as a sum here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 354.65999999999997,
          "end": 358.40999999999997,
          "en": "So that's now the ExpensesSummary component all ready",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 358.40999999999997,
          "end": 360.42,
          "en": "with some logic added to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 360.42,
          "end": 362.86,
          "en": "but that's the component we will need later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 362.86,
          "end": 366.223,
          "en": "for outputting a summary of all our expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 367.361,
          "end": 370.17,
          "en": "In ExpensesOutput, we're using this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 370.17,
          "end": 372.32,
          "en": "and we're passing all the necessary data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 372.32,
          "end": 375.44,
          "en": "into ExpensesSummary through props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
